Z||000007||Urchin||08-13-2001||07:34 PM||||Well, we know which is the better car  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>I have to admit that the newer ford probes aren't bad looking.  As for the rest...  yuck.   As for reliability, it is often luck of the draw as to whether you purchase a good reliable car or a lemon.  The probe is no different.  My step-mother had a 88 probe.  Nothing but trouble.  I have a few friends who have owned newer ones and they have experienced the same.  So saying that fieros are not reliable is a little hypocritical if you ask me.  So I guess it just depends on how it has been taken care of in the past and your luck.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
